{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主喜欢的居家装修风格是？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n命主八字为癸丑、庚申、壬辰、壬子，日主壬水生于申月，金当令，庚申双体生水，时柱壬子强水帮身，全局水势浩荡，为身旺之局。金水相涵，聪慧灵秀，但旺水喜土制、火暖、木泄。局中丑辰湿土虽为堤岸，但力弱难制水，且缺火调候，格局偏寒湿。\n\n性格与审美倾向：\n- **日坐辰土**：辰为水库，又带“华盖”星，华盖主艺术、玄学、孤高之性，喜收藏、研究奇珍古玩，对神秘文化（如风水、古董）有天然兴趣。\n- **月干庚金偏印**：偏印星透出，心性敏锐，好独特、冷门事物，审美偏向古典、怀旧或有文化底蕴的风格，不喜随众流俗。\n- **水旺无火**：缺火则少艳丽张扬，居家不喜炫目高调（排除A的高科技炫酷）；水力泛滥时，喜简洁清净，但华盖与偏印的收藏癖好，排斥“极简无物”（排除D）。\n- **湿寒需平衡**：现实中易向往温暖厚重感，土为官杀，代表传统、稳定，中式风格的古朴与风水摆设既能补土调候，又合华盖、偏印之性。欧式虽高贵，但“古灵精怪摆设”偏于猎奇，不如中式风水物品深切其命理根基。\n\n综上，命主最可能钟情**中式复古风格**，以古董、风水摆件营造沉稳有根、玄雅并蓄的居家环境。\n\n### 最终答案\nC", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q27", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 18816, "response_id": "261ea2af-4c96-4baf-a349-d79650b89f77", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 240, "completion_tokens": 980, "total_tokens": 1220, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 588}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 112}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "在丙辰大限（43–52），命主在哪一年出国创业？和什么领域相关？", "expected_answer": "B", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析，壬水日主生于申月，庚金透出，地支申子辰三合水局，时柱壬子，水势极旺，身强印旺，比劫重重。命局喜火、土、木，忌金、水。丙辰大运（43-52岁），丙火偏财透出，但辰土坐支加重水势，财星易受比劫争夺，此运求财需把握流年机遇。\n\n创业出国看印星与变动。原局印旺护身，有远行发展之象。选项中四流年：\n- 2017丁酉，丁壬合，财星被合，酉金加强原局忌神印星，不利创业。\n- 2018戊戌，干支一气七杀，强力制衡旺水比劫，戊土合去劫财癸水，戌土冲动命局辰库，为强大变动信号。戊戌为喜用土，七杀主事业开创，恰逢机遇。\n- 2019己亥，己土正官坐亥水比肩，官星虚浮无力，亥为驿马虽有动象，但事业基础不稳，不如戊戌之力。\n\n领域对应五行：房地产业属土，为命主喜用神，可制水护财，最为契合；饮食属火（亦为喜用，但2015年不在丙辰大限内）；儿童培训属木（需食伤，流年未显）；酒店住宿属金水忌神。戊戌年土旺发力，选择土属性行业发展最为有利。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q28", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 32555, "response_id": "249cee1d-0fc8-4c58-b4e7-dcb039162ede", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 2185, "total_tokens": 2426, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1838}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "先分析命主八字与大运流年。\n\n命主八字为癸丑、庚申、壬辰、壬子。日主壬水生于申月，地支申子辰三合水局，天干又见壬癸，水势极旺，为身强印旺之局。印星（庚申、辛）为忌神，喜木泄水、土制水、火暖局。\n\n大运排盘：命主为阴年（癸丑）男，大运逆排。出生日距立秋约16天，3天为1岁，约5岁起运。大运依次为：己未（5-14）、戊午（15-24）、丁巳（25-34）、丙辰（35-44）、乙卯（45-54）、甲寅（55-64）。2021年命主48岁，正行乙卯伤官大运。\n\n2021年流年为辛丑。辛金正印透出，坐丑土正官。乙卯大运遇辛丑流年，天干发生乙辛冲，为伤官与正印强烈冲克。此象主变动、冲突，印星受伤明显。同时，辛丑之丑土伏吟年支丑（父母宫），且丑为庚金印星之墓库，年柱父母宫伏吟并引动印星入墓，为母亲大凶之兆。此外，辛金正印可代表母亲，被大运乙卯冲克，又入墓库，母亲健康极危。结合2021年新冠疫情背景，辛为肺，印星入墓受冲，正应母亲染疫去世之象。\n\n乙卯伤官为喜，代表生意投资，被流年辛金冲克，事业财运必受打击；但更核心且直接的凶象聚焦于印星与父母宫，故母亲之事为最重大变故。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 38759, "response_id": "b853028a-09f5-4341-879d-acd69829798c", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 241, "completion_tokens": 2690, "total_tokens": 2931, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2280}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 113}}
{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "首先分析命主八字原局：日主壬水，生于申月，庚金旺极，又得时柱壬子阳刃相扶，全局金水泛滥，身强无疑。命局喜木火土，忌金水。日柱壬辰，辰为水库兼七杀，又为华盖。\n\n进入2024甲辰年，命主51岁，正行乙卯伤官大运。流年甲辰与日柱壬辰形成“日柱伏吟”，且两辰自刑，主身心不安、病痛呻吟。天干甲木食神透出，本为吉神，但与月干庚金偏印紧贴相冲，构成“枭神夺食”，此为突发疾病、饮食不进、肿瘤之兆，庚金通根月令申金，枭印极旺，甲木受伤严重。庚金代表骨骼、呼吸系统及鼻子，甲木为头部、神经系统；枭神夺食叠加日柱伏吟，极易引发头面部位的重症。结合原局金水过旺、庚申偏印无制，命主或有长期吸烟嗜好，金受烟熏，相由心生，鼻部病变最为应象。\n\n此外，大运乙卯与时柱壬子子卯相刑，卯辰相穿，亦有筋骨疼痛之征，但综合“枭神夺食”之主象，健康问题更倾向于因不良习惯引发的癌变，而非单纯外伤。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 56945, "response_id": "13c634e1-6c26-43f2-8289-0a03236edaf2", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 238, "completion_tokens": 3555, "total_tokens": 3793, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 3240}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 110}}
{"case_id": "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", "domain": "family", "question": "命主原生家庭父母亲状况？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "C", "raw_answer": "首先，八字分析父母关系主要看年柱和月柱。年为父母宫，月为父母宫。命主年柱戊辰，月柱甲寅。天干甲木克戊土，地支寅木克辰土，构成天克地克，父母宫严重冲克，主原生家庭父母婚姻不睦，有分离之象。\n\n其次，父母星定位：日主庚金，偏财为父，正印为母。原局正印不显，以年干戊土偏印为母，月干甲木偏财为父。甲木得月令而强旺，坐禄于寅，戊土坐辰土虽有根，但被强木紧贴相克，且寅辰会木局，土根动摇，母星受损严重，主母亲弱势或缘分浅薄。\n\n再次，日主庚金生于寅月身弱，喜印比扶身，然印星受克，与母缘薄；财星旺而为忌，但与日主相克，父缘亦有波折。日支子水伤官，与年支辰、时支申三合水局，水势泄金，并冲动月令寅木，亦加剧家庭动荡。综合判断，父母离异，因母星受克力重难以依靠，而财星强旺，命主更可能与父亲生活。\n\n最终答案：C", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "taiwan_female_19880215_P007-Q31", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P1_G3.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 24040, "response_id": "73a647e5-ef23-4909-a51c-327f8765f878", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 223, "completion_tokens": 1568, "total_tokens": 1791, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1272}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 95}}
